f\");\n    for n in [1usize, 7, 8, 9, 31, 32, 33, 64, 100, 1000] {\n        let mut a = vec![0u8; n];\n        let mut b = vec![0u8; n];\n        reset_rngs(RNG_SEED_BASE ^ n as u64);\n        unsafe { c(a.as_mut_ptr(), n) };\n        reset_rngs(RNG_SEED_BASE ^ n as u64);\n        unsafe { r(b.as_mut_ptr(), n) };\n        eq_bytes(&format!(\"randombytes_buf({n})\"), &a, &b);\n    }\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn keygen_is_deterministic_and_matches() {\n    setup();\n    let (c, r) = pair::<unsafe extern \"C\" fn(*mut u8)>(\"crypto_secretbox_keygen\");\n    let mut a = [0u8; 32];\n    let mut b = [0u8; 32];\n    reset_rngs(99);\n    unsafe { c(a.as_mut_ptr()) };","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01Aw2j196PG6UFGUL4fdGJ7V","session_id":"d07924e0-d479-4dd8-8d3b-8728ce2d0a77","uuid":"810532e0-5c9d-4c73-8cde-57dd919e927d","timestamp":"2026-08-23T08:29:46.095Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Phase B+C tests: sodium+randombytes"}
