tf + poly1305 primitives, not just C-vs-Rust.\n* `crypto_sign_ed25519_open`: `smlen < 64` leaves `m` untouched, verify-failure zeroes exactly `smlen-64` bytes — asserted with canaries in all four `m`/`mlen_p` NULL combinations.\n* `crypto_kx`'s per-index interleaved `rx`/`tx` writes with NULL retargeting and `rx == tx` aliasing.\n* Out of process: all 29 `sodium_misuse()` rows exit 77 identically with identical pre-abort side effects (e.g. secretstream `_pull` really does print `obs=0000000000000000ff…`, i.e. `*mlen_p=0` + `*tag_p=0xff` written before the abort), and all 5 `key == NULL, keylen > blocksize` rows die with SIGSEGV (139) in **both** libraries.\n\n## Two documentation errors found in the Phase-A tables (C is ground truth)\n\n1. **`CONFIGS.md` G5-140** claims an all-zero 32-byte key \"MUST produce different tags\" from `keylen = 0`. It does not — `pad[i] ^= key[i]` with a zero key is a no-op, so both libraries produce byte-identical tags. My test asserts equality, with a comment explaining why.\n2. **`ERRORS.md` G5-070** claims \"a signature with `sig[63] = 0x20` and canonical S is accepted\". A canonical S is `< L`, whose top byte is `0x10`, so `sig[63] <= 0x10` always — the legacy `sig[63] & 224` mask is unobservable either way. The test asserts `sig[63] <= 0x10` for real signatures and drives the active `#else` branch (canonical-S + `ge25519_is_canonical(pk)`) instead.\n\n## Divergence in another agent's subtree\n\n`cargo test --no-default-features --no-fail-fast` is green for every target except **`tests/t13_pwhash_errors.rs`** (G2 / `src/crypto_pwhash`, not mine): `argon2_decode_string_rejections` FAILS and `argon2_encode_string_rejections` aborts the test binary with SIGABRT, killing the remaining 25 tests in that file. Reporting, not fixing.\n\n## Final summary lines\n\n```\nt16_box_sign:            ok. 29 passed; 0 failed  (0.62s)\nt17_box_sign_errors:     ok. 21 passed; 0 failed  (4.68s)\nfull suite: every target ok except t13_pwhash_errors (SIGABRT, G2 subtree)\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":675,"cache_read_input_tokens":399267,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":675,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_018AKqc9oZCiiirxxs7Qyssn","session_id":"d07924e0-d479-4dd8-8d3b-8728ce2d0a77","uuid":"c7741fad-e84b-4c62-82d0-a9b41f3fb475","timestamp":"2026-08-23T09:12:39.409Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Phase B+C tests: box/secretbox/sign/kx/auth"}
