ust` sequence. Both of my files use a file-local `RNG_LOCK` for this (it caused a real, reproducible false failure before I added it).","usage":{"total_tokens":463703,"tool_uses":149,"duration_ms":4070123},"uuid":"768ec264-2ac0-4596-b1cd-7fb3621a5ed6","session_id":"d07924e0-d479-4dd8-8d3b-8728ce2d0a77"}
